    "title": "Reality_Anchor",
    "version": 1,
    "description": "Reality Anchor is a Sokoban-like prototype where movable two-cell anchors split the board into rule regions. A P/L anchor selects push or pull behavior by the player's side at input time. A B/S anchor globally normalizes boxes into sticky blocks on the sticky side and back into boxes on the box side.\n",
